# Zealous Display on Bot1's own turn: Bot1's attacking Ornithopter (0/2) becomes 2/2 and stays tapped ("If it's not your turn"
# is false); Bot2's Ornithopter is not "you control" and stays 0/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Zealous Display
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Zealous Display.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
